<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">亲友访问</view><view class="title"><text>一份密令，
一起吃饭。</text></view><block wx:if="{{secret}}"><view class="section"><view class="muted">当前日常密令</view><view class="row"><text>{{secret.configured ? (revealed ? secret.passcode : '••••••') : '尚未设置'}}</text><text class="link" wx:if="{{secret.configured}}" bindtap="reveal">{{revealed ? '隐藏' : '查看'}}</text><text class="link" wx:if="{{secret.configured}}" bindtap="copy">复制</text></view></view><view class="section"><view>设置新密令</view><input class="input" value="{{value}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="20" placeholder="6—20位数字或英文字母"/><view class="link" bindtap="generate">随机生成一个</view><view class="muted">修改密令后，亲友已有的访问资格仍保留。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存密令</button></view><view class="notice">持有效密令的亲友可看到当前开放餐次的菜品和参与者显示名。</view><button class="danger" wx:if="{{secret.configured}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="revoke">撤销全部亲友日常资格</button></block><view class="error">{{error}}</view></view>
